node_modules/
.claude
.mcp.*
# Local MCP config stays untracked; copy .mcp.json.example to .mcp.json.
# Atlassian must use "type": "http" with the /v1/mcp endpoint -- "sse" fails
# with HTTP 400 (looks like an auth error, isn't), and /v1/sse is no longer
# supported by Atlassian after 2026-06-30. Restart Claude Code after editing.
!.mcp.json.example
